    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Population growth is a cross-sectoral issue that impacts all aspects of life, including economy, education, health and environment. Pakistan has the modern contraceptive prevalence rate of 25 per cent, which is one of the lowest in South Asia. Lack of access to such services is a major driver of maternal mortality, poor health and exclusion for women and girls.",
